<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#E66914"><title>Entrar | ImpriMarte</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css"></head>
<body class="login-body">
  <div class="login-shell">
    <section class="login-brand-panel"><div class="login-brand-art"><span class="orb orb-1"></span><span class="orb orb-2"></span></div><div><span class="login-eyebrow">IMPRIMARTE ADMIN</span><h1>Controle seu site com clareza e agilidade.</h1><p>Produtos, categorias, campanhas e identidade visual em um painel único.</p><div class="login-features"><span><i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i> Catálogo</span><span><i class="bi bi-images"></i> Banners</span><span><i class="bi bi-palette"></i> Identidade</span></div></div></section>
    <form class="login-card" method="post"><a href="/" class="login-logo"><img src="<%= settings?.site_logo_path || '/img/logo.png' %>" alt="ImpriMarte"></a><div><span class="login-eyebrow">BEM-VINDO</span><h2>Acessar painel</h2><p>Use suas credenciais administrativas.</p></div><% if(error){ %><div class="alert error"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle-fill"></i><span><%= error %></span></div><% } %><label><span>E-mail</span><div class="login-input"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i><input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="seu@email.com"></div></label><label><span>Senha</span><div class="login-input"><i class="bi bi-lock"></i><input type="password" name="password" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••"></div></label><button class="admin-btn login-submit"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Entrar no painel</button><a class="back-site" href="/"><i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Voltar ao site</a></form>
  </div>
</body></html>
